WEBVTT

00:03:59.288 --> 00:04:05.121
And what we find
is that the same patterns of bias,

00:04:05.163 --> 00:04:07.329
the same five patterns,

00:04:07.371 --> 00:04:09.746
they emerge over and over again.

00:04:09.788 --> 00:04:12.038
So here's what the evidence looks like.

00:04:12.079 --> 00:04:16.204
The first pattern we call
"prove it again."

00:04:16.246 --> 00:04:19.913
Some groups have to prove themselves
more than others.

00:04:20.538 --> 00:04:22.829
This is triggered
by lots of different things.

00:04:22.829 --> 00:04:26.329
It's triggered by race and gender,

00:04:26.371 --> 00:04:30.954
age, disability, LGBTQ status,